stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SCHEDULED: batch-service schedules a session (event)
    SCHEDULED --> LIVE: host joins, room created
    SCHEDULED --> CANCELLED: session-cancelled event
    LIVE --> ENDED: End class button
    LIVE --> ENDED: sweep job settles an abandoned room
    ENDED --> [*]: attendance computed and sent to batch-service
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of LIVE
        Open questions are closed and any recording
        is stopped at the moment of ending.
        Students may use mic, camera and screen
        only as the room rules allow.
    end note
